SUMMARY:Santa in the Village
DESCRIPTION:We are celebrating the 10th Annual Santa in the Village with a FREE family event filled with holiday fun\, activities for all ages\, and plenty of reasons to shop local. \n🗓️ Saturday\, November 21 | 10 AM – 4 PM📍 Green P Parking Lot (Carpark 91)\, 265 Armadale Ave \n🎁 Here’s what’s in store:\n🔹 Photos with Santa (reservation required)\n🔹 Festive carolers and live music\n🔹 Kids’ entertainment and costumed characters\n🔹 Festive Express holiday choo-choo train rides\n🔹 Holiday Marketplace with local artisans and shops\n🔹 Explore Bloor West Village’s local shops\, discover thoughtful gifts\, enjoy festive treats and find plenty of holiday shopping inspiration. \n📸 Photos with Santa for a Great Cause!\nReservations open November 14\, with limited spots available. Each photo is $10\, with 100% of proceeds going to the Bloor West Food Bank. Stay tune for the registration link! \n✨ Gather your family and celebrate the magic of the season with us in the Village.
URL:https://www.bloorwestvillagebia.com/event/santa-in-the-village/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.bloorwestvillagebia.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Santa.png
END:VEVENT
